WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
In <00:00:00.160>the <00:00:00.300>Sermon <00:00:00.680>on <00:00:00.840>the <00:00:01.020>Mount,

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.700
Christ <00:00:02.040>moves <00:00:02.420>the <00:00:02.640>battle <00:00:02.920>from <00:00:03.260>the <00:00:03.440>hands

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.380
to <00:00:04.000>the <00:00:04.120>heart:

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.920
to <00:00:04.760>our <00:00:04.900>thoughts, <00:00:05.860>our <00:00:05.880>desires <00:00:06.280>and <00:00:06.720>our

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:07.380
intentions.
